tyle=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/fcd800adc98c07fbb5be66bfe528ab5a_2164278930262768609.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/49399dbc4605b7851fd00da54d138877_2987638521991137025.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>火箭锤</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/12/02/50494840/0244a32bbac27b52d85024c45bc6cc82_4489000926992039187.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"width:775px;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">非主流锤法</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I /II /III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">全队角色全伤害提高(</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">2.0％/4.0%/6.0%</span></span></strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">)，</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">状态期间全队角色全元素伤害提高(</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">3.0％/6.5%/10.0%</span></span></strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">)（唯一生效）</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">千锤打锣，一锤静音</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">角色释放武器技能时，提高自身火焰元素伤害<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">22.0％</span></strong>，持续15秒，可刷新。【女武神·重机】使用时，【认真一锤】最后一击范围增加，额外造成<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">400.0％</span></strong>攻击力的火焰元素伤害。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">小锤伺时，大锤霸世</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">每次释放武器技能为全场敌人叠加一层【当头一锤】效果，提高敌人受到的全伤害</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">6.0％</span></span></strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">，持续时间25秒，可叠加2层，重复触发刷新持续时间（唯一生效）。【女武神·重机】使用时，【当头一锤】叠加上限变为3层，释放必杀技也会叠加一层易伤效果。进入</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">态时为全场敌人叠加3层易伤效果。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">材料-消耗品</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/3664/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">「无间拍档」武器自选箱</a></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">活动获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">参与主线第二部第一章<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">「百年孤影」获取</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">消耗</span><a href=\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"a\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">兑换获得</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 4;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgrou